   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 11,
   "start": 422.47,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "所以绝对误差量的是，错了多少钱。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 426.53,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "百分比误差量的是，错了百分之几。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "intuition",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 430.39,
   "dur": 3.09,
   "speech": "两个问题都对，答案不同。"
  },
